{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hKbzVjVQiM1794298904.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報內地人工智能(AI)企業月之暗面繞過美國限制，取得輝達先進晶片使用權。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》引述監管文件指，公司於8月已簽署合約，租用32部超微電腦伺服器，每部均配備輝達B300 GPU晶片，為現時最先進AI處理器。文件顯示，這批伺服器位於中國境內估值達4.3億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>資料顯示，輝達早於2022年起，就被禁止向中國出售先進晶片，不過內地AI企業一直透過不同方法，例如租用馬來西亞等境外地區的伺服器，以獲取相關先進算力。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.638516+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T08:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T00:02:24.701895+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:14.912437+00:00","content_hash":"99aa14e5ccfa81d39ac6a3e69acf4e3cbaee7288134128e1f5a98d317f2207d2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.638516+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}